<metadata><name>Caw Ridge</name><desc>Waypoints, the drive from Grande Cache and the computed walking line. Planning aid only.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="54.062707" lon="-119.390728"><ele>1991</ele><name>Waypoint</name><desc>The point this guide is built around. It sits in a high bowl with a short view.</desc><type>waypoint</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.052100" lon="-119.391739"><ele>2026</ele><name>G1 glassing point</name><desc>Sees 6.8 km2 of open ground within 3 km. 1.2 km from the waypoint, bearing 183 true.</desc><type>glassing</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.024868" lon="-119.336665"><ele>2160</ele><name>G2 glassing point</name><desc>Sees 6.4 km2 of open ground within 3 km. 5.5 km from the waypoint, bearing 140 true.</desc><type>glassing</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.047517" lon="-119.321061"><ele>1918</ele><name>G3 glassing point</name><desc>Sees 5.5 km2 of open ground within 3 km. 4.9 km from the waypoint, bearing 110 true.</desc><type>glassing</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.021631" lon="-119.322896"><ele>2008</ele><name>G4 glassing point</name><desc>Sees 4.9 km2 of open ground within 3 km. 6.4 km from the waypoint, bearing 136 true.</desc><type>glassing</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.041047" lon="-119.388985"><ele>1950</ele><name>G5 glassing point</name><desc>Sees 4.6 km2 of open ground within 3 km. 2.4 km from the waypoint, bearing 177 true.</desc><type>glassing</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.055065" lon="-119.424783"><ele>2017</ele><name>G6 glassing point</name><desc>Sees 4.5 km2 of open ground within 3 km. 2.4 km from the waypoint, bearing 249 true.</desc><type>glassing</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.034037" lon="-119.426160"><ele>2021</ele><name>G7 glassing point</name><desc>Sees 3.0 km2 of open ground within 3 km. 3.9 km from the waypoint, bearing 216 true.</desc><type>glassing</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.068807" lon="-119.457369"><ele>2020</ele><name>G8 glassing point</name><desc>Sees 2.8 km2 of open ground within 3 km. 4.4 km from the waypoint, bearing 279 true.</desc><type>glassing</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.068003" lon="-119.389988"><ele>2002</ele><name>End of mapped track</name><desc>Where the track drawn in OpenStreetMap stops. Riders report old roads along most of the ridge line.</desc><type>road</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.095806" lon="-119.323930"><ele>1284</ele><name>Caw Ridge turnoff</name><desc>Leave the gravel here. 8.1 km of old exploration road climbs to the ridge. A staging area is reported at the turnoff.</desc><type>road</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="53.924359" lon="-119.176448"><ele>973</ele><name>Beaverdam Road turnoff</name><desc>Leave Highway 40 here, 8 km north of Grande Cache. The road crosses coal mine property: stay on Beaverdam Road.</desc><type>road</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="53.888100" lon="-119.118600"><ele>1257</ele><name>Grande Cache</name><desc>Fuel, groceries, lodging, tourism centre. Last services.</desc><type>service</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="53.890938" lon="-119.118909"><ele>1261</ele><name>Grande Cache hospital</name><desc>Grande Cache Community Health Complex, 10200 Shand Avenue. Emergency department open 24 hours. Helipad.</desc><type>service</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="53.888584" lon="-119.113488"><ele>1260</ele><name>Fuel: Fas Gas</name><desc>Fuel in Grande Cache.</desc><type>service</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="53.891731" lon="-119.115951"><ele>1266</ele><name>Fuel: Petro-Canada</name><desc>Fuel in Grande Cache.</desc><type>service</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="54.062174" lon="-119.011219"><ele>902</ele><name>Sheep Creek campground</name><desc>Provincial recreation area on Highway 40, 25 km north of Grande Cache. Boat launch.</desc><type>camp</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="53.890360" lon="-119.158516"><ele>961</ele><name>Smoky River South campground</name><desc>Provincial recreation area, 22 unserviced sites. Usually open to Thanksgiving.</desc><type>camp</type></wpt>
<wpt lat="53.850132" lon="-119.186183"><ele>1011</ele><name>Sulphur Gates campground</name><desc>Provincial recreation area and Willmore staging. 11 sites, open all year. Firearm discharge permit rules apply here.</desc><type>camp</type></wpt>
